      "writtenOn": "2026-10-20T15:41:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "They serve different purposes. EmptyKeystoreAccess is the package-private\nsingleton behind KeystoreAccess.empty(), for non-OSGi callers (Dagger, tests,\nthe NetconfClientFactoryImpl constructors without a keystore). NoneKeystoreAccess\nis the OSGi component that registers a KeystoreAccess service with the lowest\nranking, so the mandatory reference in NetconfClientFactoryImpl is satisfied\nwhen keystore-legacy is not installed. keystore-api is a plain API bundle\nwithout DS, so the component cannot live there.",
      "parentUuid": "97be0ba0_f519dbed",
      "revId": "c0fe504da66dedc63a06d3df4ec12de0daf4f7c6",
      "serverId": "7fc14799-209e-464c-9743-7a06c2c21a81"
